nd exit\npreparation.\n Helped prepare welcome materials and practical onboarding instructions for new hi[ADDRESS_REDACTED]prove accuracy of employee profiles and organizational charts.\n Coordinated with IT, office management, and HR team members to ensure onboarding tasks were completed before the\nemployee start date.\nAdministrative HR Intern — [NAME_REDACTED] (2020 – 2021)\n Assisted the HR team with new employee setup, induction scheduling, and HRIS updates.\n Checked employee profile information for accuracy and flagged missing HRIS fields to the HR coordinator.\nEducation & Certifications\n Bachelor in [NAME_REDACTED] — Université de Tunis\n HRIS [NAME_REDACTED]\n [NAME_REDACTED] [NAME_REDACTED] — native · French — fluent · English — professional','[]',NULL,'{\"name\": \"Lina Trabelsi\", \"role\": \"HR Onboarding & HRIS Assistant\", \"email\": \"7cb760e3b7@emailinbo.live\", \"score\": 20.0, \"skills\": [\"Onboarding Execution\", \"New Hire Onboarding\", \"Induction Coordination\", \"Employee Profile Setup\", \"HRIS Data Accuracy\", \"Employee Master Data Updates\", \"HRIS Data Entry\", \"HRIS Quality Checks\", \"Start-Date Coordination\", \"Employee Lifecycle Updates\", \"Internal HR Coordination\"], \"summary\": \"Lina Trabelsi is an HR Onboarding & HRIS Assistant with three years of experience in onboarding execution and HRIS data accuracy, matching key onboarding and HRIS skills in the rubric. However, she lacks demonstrated experience in sourcing, interviewing, labor law compliance, employee relations, and process improvement.\", \"rationale\": \"The CV covers onboarding execution and HRIS data accuracy, satisfying a few rubric skills, but misses many core competencies such as sourcing, interviewing, labor law alignment, employee relations, and process optimization, resulting in an average match.\", \"coverage_pct\": 20.0, \"rubric_match\": {\"rubric_id\": 3, \"rubric_title\": \"HR Specialist manager\", \"total_skills\": 10, \"matched_skills\": [{