ation\", \"category\": \"Community Engagement\"}], \"missing_skills\": [{\"name\": \"Conflict Resolution\", \"category\": \"Community Engagement\"}, {\"name\": \"Community Building\", \"category\": \"Community Engagement\"}, {\"name\": \"Writing\", \"category\": \"Content Creation\"}, {\"name\": \"Video Production\", \"category\": \"Content Creation\"}, {\"name\": \"Graphic Design\", \"category\": \"Content Creation\"}, {\"name\": \"Social Media Management\", \"category\": \"Technical Skills\"}, {\"name\": \"Data Analysis\", \"category\": \"Technical Skills\"}, {\"name\": \"Platform Management\", \"category\": \"Technical Skills\"}], \"match_percentage\": 6}, \"skill_scores\": {\"Writing\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 40.0, \"category\": \"Content Creation\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Writing in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.12}, \"Communication\": {\"level\": \"direct\", \"score\": 50.0, \"weight\": 30.0, \"category\": \"Community Engagement\", \"feedback\": \"Direct conceptual Communication evidence in CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.12}, \"Data Analysis\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 30.0, \"category\": \"Technical Skills\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Data Analysis in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.09}, \"Graphic Design\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 30.0, \"category\": \"Content Creation\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Graphic Design in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.09}, \"Video Production\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 30.0, \"category\": \"Content Creation\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Video Production in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.09}, \"Community Building\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 45.0, \"category\": \"Community Engagement\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Community Building in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.18}, \"Conflict Resolution\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 25.0, \"category\": \"Community Engagement\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Conflict Resolution in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.1}, \"Platform Management\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 20.0, \"category\": \"Technical Skills\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Platform Management in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.06}, \"Social Media Management\": {\"level\": \"none\", \"score\": 0.0, \"weight\": 50.0, \"category\": \"Technical Skills\", \"feedback\": \"No evidence of Social Media Management in the CV\", \"normalized_weight\": 0.15}}, \"missing_skills\": [\"Conflict Resolution\", \"Community Building\", \"Writing\", \"Video Production\", \"Graphic Design\", \"Social Media Management\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Platform Management\"], \"scoring_method\": \"deterministic_keyword_weighted\", \"cv_rubric_weighted\": true, \"normalized_weights\": {\"Writing\": 0.12, \"Communication\": 0.12, \"Data Analysis\": 0.09, \"Graphic Design\": 0.09, \"Video Production\": 0.09, \"Community Building\": 0.18, \"Conflict Resolution\": 0.1, \"Platform Management\": 0.06, \"Social Media Management\": 0.15}, \"matched_rubric_skills\": [\"Communication\"], \"missing_rubric_skills\": [\"Conflict Resolution\", \"Community Building\", \"Writing\", \"Video Production\", \"Graphic Design\", \"Social Media Management\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Platform Management\"]}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-05 22:20:23','2026-09-05 22:20:23',1,NULL,5),(18,20,NULL,'/uploads/upload_22_1788674387_9cbbf782c367.pdf','C E O  -  M o u s a w a 9  \nJ a n  2 0 2 3  -  A o u t  2 0 2 5\nP r o s p e c t i o n  p a r  t é l é p h o n e  e t  e - m a i l ,  g e s t i o n  d e s  b a s e s  d e  d o n n é e s  e t  r e p o r t i n g .\nA n a l y s e  d e s  d o n n é e s  m a r k e t i n g  p o u r  s e g m e n t e r  l e s  a u d i e n c e s  e t  c r é e r  d e s  c a m p a g n e s  p u b l i c i t a i r e s\nm u l t i m é d i a s .\nR é a l i s a t i o n  d \' é t u d e s  d e  m a r c h é  q u a l i t a t i v e s  e t  q u a n t i t a t i v e s  p o u r  o r i e n t e r  l e s  d é c i s i o n s  m a r k e t i n g .\nC o o r d i n a t i o n  a v e c  l e s  é q u i p e s  d e  v e n t e  e t  d e  p r o d u c t i o n  p o u r  o p t i m i s e r  l e s  e f f o r t s .\nI d e n t i f i c a t i o n  e t  n é g o c i a t i o n  d e  p a r t e n a r i a t s  s t r a t é g i q u e s  p o u r  a c c r o î t r e  l a  n o t o r i é t é  d e  l \' e n t r e p r i s e .\nR e s p o n s a b l e  M a r k e t i n g  -  L e u c i l l i n  s a  \nA o u t  2 0 2 4  -  J a n  2 0 2 5\nÉ l a b o r a t i o n  d e  s t r a t é g i e s  d e  c o m m u n i c a t i o n  p o u r  l e s  p r o d u i t s  d e  s o i n .\nC r é a t i o n  d e  c a m p a g n e s  p u b l i c i t a i r e s  s u r  l e s  r é s e a u x  s o c i a u x .\nC o o r d i n a t i o n  a v e c  l e s  é q u i p e s  c o m m e r c i a l e s  p o u r  p r o m o t i o n s  e t  p a r t e n a r i a t s .\nA u g m e n t a t i o n  d e  l a  v i s i b i l i t é  d e  l a  m a r q u e  e t  d e  l \' e n g a g e m e n t  c l i e n t  v i a  l e  m a r k e t i n g  d i g i t a l .\n \nJ a n v i e r  -  F é v r i e r  2 0 2 5\nm o n j i  s l i m  s i l i a n a  |  r a y e n h e n i 8 @ g m a i l . c o m\nP r o f e s s i o n n e l  p o s s é d a n t  d e  n o m b r e u s e s  a n n é e s  d \' e x p é r i e n c e  d a n s  l e  d o m a i n e  d e  l \' e - c o m m e r c e ,  a s s o c i é  à  u n e\nf o r m a t i o n  a p p r o f o n d i e  e n  t e c h n i q u e s  d e  v e n t e  e t  u n e  g r a n d e  c a p a c i t é  d \' a p p r e n t i s s a g e .  J e  s u i s  c a p a b l e  d e\nt r a v a i l l e r  a u s s i  b i e n  e n  é q u i p e  q u \' e n  a u t o n o m i e ,  t o u t  e n  f a i s a n t  p r e u v e  d \' u n  e x c e l l e n t  s e n s  d e  l \' o r g a n i s a t i o n  e t\nd e  c o m p é t e n c e s  r e c o n n u e s  e n  m a r k e t i n g  d i g i t a l  a i n s i  q u \' e n  a n a l y s e  d e s  p e r f o r m a n c e s .\nE X P É R I E N C E  P R O F E S S I O N N E L L E\nC o m m u n i t y  M a n a g e r  e t  S o c i a l  M e d i a  M a n a g e r - T a t w e e r s o f t\nG e s t i o n  d e s  m é d i a s  s o c i a u x  p o u r  p r o m o u v o i r  l e s  s o l u t i o n s  l o g i c i e l l e s .\nC r é a t i o n  d e  c o n t e n u  e n g a g e a n t  p o u r  a t t i r e r  d e s  p r o s p e c t s  q u a l i f i é s .\nM i s e  e n  p l a c e  d e  s t r a t é g i e s  d e  c r o i s s a n c e  o r g a n i q u e  e t  p a y a n t e  p o u r  r e n f o r c e r  l a  p r é s e n c e  e n\nl i g n e .\nA n a l y s e  d e s  r é s u l t a t s  d e s  c a m p a g n e s  p o u r  o p t i m i s e r  l a  s t r a t é g i e  e t  a c c r o î t r e  l e s  c o n v e r s i o n s .\nR A Y E N  E L H E N I\n C O M M U N I T Y  M A N A G E R\nG e s t i o n  d \' é q u i p e  \nV i s i o n  e n t r e p r e n e u r i a l e\nA n a l y s e  d e  d o n n é e s\nM a r k e t i n g  d i g i t a l\nE - c o m m e r c e  l o c a l e  \nD e s i g n  g r a p h i q u e\nC O M P É T E N C E S\nL i c e n s e  e n  c o m m e r c e  e t  d i s t r i b u t i o n  -  T e c h n i q u e s  d e  v e n t e  \ni n s t i t u t  s u p é r i e u r  d e s  e t u d e s  t e c h n o l o g i q u e  s i l i a n a\nb a c c a l a u r é a t  s e c t i o n  t e c h n i q u e  \nm o n j i  s l i m  s i l i a n a\nS e p  2 0 2 2  -  j u i n  2 0 2 5\nS e p  2 0 2 1  -  J u i n  2 0 2 2\nE D U C A T I O N\nL a n g u e s :  A n g l a i s ,  F r a n ç a i s ,  A r a b e  .\nC e r t i f i c a t i o n s :  O n e  m i l l i o n  a r a b i c  c o d e r s  c e r t i f i c a t  ,  b a s i c  o f  m a r k e t i n g  d i g i t a l e  b y  g o o g l e  .  \nA w a r d s / A c t i v i t i e s :  g a g n a n t  d e  b o o t c a m p  “  b u s i n e s s  p l a n  “  c e n t r e  e l i f  s i l i a n a  ,  p r o j e t  s u b v e n t i o n n é  p a r\nc i n e m a r e n a  I O M  \nI N F O R M A T I O N S  C O M P L É M E N T A I R E S','[]',NULL,'{\"score\": 72, \"summary\": \"I have several years leading digital marketing initiatives, managing social media channels, and analyzing performance data, which aligns with the general role’s focus on marketing and community engagement. My experience as CEO and Marketing Manager demonstrates my ability to drive brand visibility and coordinate cross‑functional teams.\", \"verdict\": \"Qualified\", \"strengths\": [\"Extensive experience in digital marketing and campaign management\", \"Proven leadership as CEO and marketing head\", \"Skilled in data analysis and social media engagement\"], \"_prompt_info\": {\"variant\": \"control\", \"version\": \"v2.1\"}, \"critical_gaps\": [\"No specific marketing tools or platforms (e.g., Google Analytics, Facebook Ads) are mentioned\", \"Lacks measurable impact metrics such as ROI, conversion rates, or audience growth percentages\", \"No technical details on database technologies or programming languages\"], \"detected_role\": \"General\", \"skill_metrics\": {\"technical\": {\"score\": 30, \"evidence\": \"Prospection par téléphone et e‑mail, gestion des bases de données, reporting, analyse des données marketing, création de campagnes publicitaires multimédias, marketing digital, e‑commerce, gestion des médias sociaux, analyse des performances\"}, \"experience\": {\"score\": 30, \"evidence\": \"CEO (Mousawa 9), Responsable Marketing (Leucillin sa), Community Manager / Social Media Manager (Tatweersoft)\"}, \"communication\": {\"score\": 12, \"evidence\": \"CV conveys responsibilities and achievements but suffers from poor formatting and spacing, reducing overall clarity\"}}, \"interview_focus_areas\": [\"Discuss specific digital marketing tools and platforms used\", \"Probe for quantitative results achieved in campaigns (e.g., % increase in engagement)\", \"Explore leadership and decision‑making experiences as CEO\"]}',NULL,NULL,'General','General','2026-09-06 05:59:47','2026-09-06 06:01:05',2,NULL,NULL);
